OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 9 DEC
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GPetroc Trelawny welcomes jazz
OL,6,     Gsinger Richard Shelton to perform
OL,7,     Ga festive set of music with his
OL,8,     GQuartet. Conductor Ellie Slorach
OL,9,     Gis also live ion the studio.
OL,10,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,11,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,12,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,13,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,14,     GIn a special concert marking his
OL,15,     G85th birthday, American pianist
OL,16,     GStephen Kovacevich is joined by
OL,17,     GMartha Argerich and the violinist
OL,18,     GIrene Duval.
