OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 9 DEC
OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GSinger-songwriter anaiis is back
OL,6,     Gwith her second Flowers pick of
OL,7,     Gthe week, and tonight she chooses
OL,8,     Gan American vocalist whose
OL,9,     Grendition of a jazz standard
OL,10,     Gdeeply influenced her.
OL,11,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,12,     GMidori performs Dvorak's Violin
OL,13,     GConcerto with the German Symphony
OL,14,     GOrchestra, Berlin. The programme
OL,15,     Galso features 'Earworms' by
OL,16,     GVivian Fung and Amy Beach's
OL,17,     G'Gaelic' Symphony.
